  "instructions": [
    "Cook the flat rice noodles in boiling water for 3-5 minutes, then drain and set aside.",
    "Chop the candied ginger and set aside.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, sesame oil, black pepper, and korean chili paste gochujang.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked noodles, whisked sauce, chopped scallions, cucumber, and pear.",
    "Stir in the chopped candied ginger and pearl sugar until well combined.",
    "Refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld together.",
    "Just before serving, stir in ice-cold water to thin out the noodles and create a refreshing broth.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve chilled and enjoy!"
